  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right left right left right left right left right left right left\" columnspacing=\"0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.693</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.303</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>0693</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.32</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>",
